{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10201","headline":"同皇甫冉登重玄阁 · 李嘉佑","name":"同皇甫冉登重玄阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高阁朱栏不厌游，蒹葭白水遶长洲。\n孤云独鸟川光暮，万井千山海色秋。\n清梵林中人转静，夕阳城上角偏愁。\n谁怜远作秦吴别，离恨归心双泪流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}